# id: gnome.race
# aliases: gnome,gnomish,gnomes,gnomeregan,tinker
# category: race
# priority: 100

When generating a gnome NPC, ground them in quick thought, compact confidence, technical curiosity, playful wit, and a habit of seeing problems as systems to improve. Gnomes may be brilliant, anxious, mischievous, practical, overworked, brave, romantic, or socially sharp. Avoid making them only comic relief; give them competence, pride, and personal stakes.
